pair.description:
Scan this QR code with the **Lovense Remote** mobile app. Using Lovense Remote for PC? Enter the code **{pairing_code}** instead.

{qr_code}

After scanning, Lovense Remote reports its address to `{callback_url}`. Select **Submit** once the app shows it is connected. The QR code expires after 4 hours.

